    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "c. 0.37 Acre Site with Full Unrestricted Planning Permission (Ref: 25/427)"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "A unique opportunity to acquire a Residential Site with Unrestricted Full Planning Permission.\r\n\r\nPlans for this home have been superbly designed to renovate and extend upon a south facing, derelict stone cottage to create a modern residence extending to approximately 170 Sq.m. (GIM) comprising of Entrance Hall, Kitchen/Dining Area, Living Room, Utility, Bathroom and 3 Bedrooms with the Master having both an ensuite and walk in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nHaving been Vacant with a substantial period of time, this property will qualify for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant with the Derelict top up (Subject to Conditions).\r\n\r\nSituated in the peaceful setting of Togher village this property is ideally located being approximately 100m to Togher National School and offers a great opportunity for those looking to put their own stamp on a property situated in a most convenient location.\r\n\r\nDunmanway (10min drive) and Bantry (30min drive).\r\n\r\nGPS: 51.767943, -9.158283\r\n\r\nImagery provided for illustrative purposes only\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: All information provided is to the best of our knowledge but is not guaranteed and should be independently verified. No warranties or representations are made regarding the accuracy, completeness, condition or planning status of the property. Interested parties should satisfy themselves as to the correctness of all information provided, including measurements, boundaries, size or acreage, BER details and services. All measurements and distances are approximate and for guidance only. Photographs and video are for illustrative purposes and may include items not included in the sale (e.g. furniture)."
      },
      {
